<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Maseca raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Maseca raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns analyst Mark Abramson on Friday upgraded his rating for Grupo Industrial Maseca to buy from attractive.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Worst news is already priced into the stock, likely to see positive developments from here,&quot; Abramson wrote in an analysis.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Valuations are cheap.&quot;</p>
<p>-- American Depositary Receipts in the company opened 1/4 to 15-5/8.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
